    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12021" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŭris</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quĭris</span></b> , ītis, f.
		Sabine, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a spear</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 2,
				477</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 9, 16</span></i>;
			Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 49, 10</span></i> Müll.; v.
			Quirites.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cŭrītis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quĭrītis</span></b> ),
				is, f., <i>a surname of
				Juno as protector of spearmen</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart.
				Cap. 2, § 149</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 1303 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8659</span></i>.</div>
